hort (4-7 days)","duration":"Multiple Sessions","results":"Gradual","procedure":"Non-Surgical"},"timeline":[],"journey":{"treatmentDate":"","stages":[]},"collections":["no-surgery-no-downtime"]},{"id":89,"title":"Hair Transplant Surgery","categories":[{"id":5,"slug":"hair-loss","name":"Hair loss"}],"category_names":["Hair loss"],"primary_category":{"id":5,"slug":"hair-loss","name":"Hair loss"},"main_before_image":"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/hair-transplant-before_watermarked.jpg?v=1795440546","main_after_image":"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/hair-transplant-after_watermarked.jpg?v=1795440547","main_before_alt":"Before: Hair Transplant Surgery","main_after_alt":"After: Hair Transplant Surgery","main_description":"","image_pairs":[],"total_pairs":1,"gender":"Female","age":"31-45","age_group":"31-45","recovery":"Minimal (1-3 days)","duration":"Single Session","results":"Gradual","procedure":"Surgical","procedure_info":"<p><strong>What it does:<\/strong><br \/>Hair transplant surgery restores hair in thinning or balding areas by moving healthy hair follicles from a donor site (usually the back or sides of the scalp) to areas with hair loss. The two main techniques are FUE (Follicular Unit Extraction) and FUT (Follicular Unit Transplantation). It\u2019s ideal for treating male or female pattern baldness.<\/p>\n<p><strong>How long it lasts:<\/strong><br \/>Transplanted hair is <strong>permanent<\/strong> and lasts a <strong>lifetime<\/strong>, although natural hair around it may continue to thin with age.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Results:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<ul>\n \t<li>\n<p>Natural-looking hair growth<\/p>\n<\/li>\n \t<li>\n<p>Increased hair density and coverage<\/p>\n<\/li>\n \t<li>\n<p>Permanent solution for bald or thinning areas<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>","featured":false,"date":"November 15, 2026","timestamp":1794736800,"category":"hair-loss","categoryName":"Hair loss","categoryNames":["Hair loss"],"beforeImg":"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/hair-transplant-before_watermarked.jpg?v=1795440546","afterImg":"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/hair-transplant-after_watermarked.jpg?v=1795440547","beforeThumb":"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/hair-transplant-before_watermarked-768x768.jpg?v=1795440546","afterThumb":"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/hair-transplant-after_watermarked-768x768.jpg?v=1795440547","beforeAlt":"Before: Hair Transplant Surgery","afterAlt":"After: Hair Transplant Surgery","imagePairs":[],"ageGroup":"31-45","procedureType":"Surgical","description":"<h2><strong>Hair Transplant Surgery<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p>Hair transplant surgery is a permanent hair restoration solution that involves relocating hair follicles from areas with dense growth to thinning or balding regions. The procedure can be done using advanced techniques like FUE or FUT, both of which deliver natural-looking, long-lasting results. It\u2019s a popular choice for individuals seeking to restore hairline, fill in bald patches, or add volume to thinning hair. Over time, the transplanted hair grows just like natural hair, blending seamlessly with existing strands.<\/p>\n","content":"<h2><strong>Hair Transplant Surgery<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p>Hair transplant surgery is a permanent hair restoration solution that involves relocating hair follicles from areas with dense growth to thinning or balding regions. The procedure can be done using advanced techniques like FUE or FUT, both of which deliver natural-looking, long-lasting results. It\u2019s a popular choice for individuals seeking to restore hairline, fill in bald patches, or add volume to thinning hair. Over time, the transplanted hair grows just like natural hair, blending seamlessly with existing strands.<\/p>\n","procedureInfo":"<p><strong>What it does:<\/strong><br \/>Hair transplant surgery restores hair in thinning or balding areas by moving healthy hair follicles from a donor site (usually the back or sides of the scalp) to areas with hair loss. The two main techniques are FUE (Follicular Unit Extraction) and FUT (Follicular Unit Transplantation). It\u2019s ideal for treating male or female pattern baldness.<\/p>\n<p><strong>How long it lasts:<\/strong><br \/>Transplanted hair is <strong>permanent<\/strong> and lasts a <strong>lifetime<\/strong>, although natural hair around it may continue to thin with age.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Results:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Natural-looking hair growth<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Increased hair density and coverage<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Permanent solution for bald or thinning areas<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","doctor":{"id":20,"name":"Dr. Daniel Okafor","slug":"daniel-okafor","photo":"","photoAlt":"Dr. Daniel Okafor","credentials":"MD \u00b7 Hair restoration and weight management","location":"Westside Clinic","url":""},"doctors":[{"id":20,"name":"Dr. Daniel Okafor","slug":"daniel-okafor","photo":"","photoAlt":"Dr. Daniel Okafor","credentials":"MD \u00b7 Hair restoration and weight management","location":"Westside Clinic","url":""}],"proFilters":{"gender":"Female","age":"31-45","recovery":"Minimal (1-3 days)","duration":"Single Session","results":"Gradual","procedure":"Surgical"},"timeline":[],"journey":{"treatmentDate":"","stages":[]},"collections":[]},{"id":37,"title":"Wrist Script Tattoo \u2014 Six Laser Sessions","categories":[{"id":6,"slug":"tattoo-removal","name":"Laser tattoo removal"}],"category_names":["Laser tattoo removal"],"primary_category":{"id":6,"slug":"tattoo-removal","name":"Laser tattoo removal"},"main_before_image":"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/wrist-script-before_watermarked.jpg?v=1795440507","main_after_image":"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/wrist-script-after_watermarked.jpg?v=1795440508","main_before_alt":"Before: inner wrist \u2014 Wrist Script Tattoo \u2014 Six Laser Sessions","main_after_alt":"After: inner wrist \u2014 Wrist Script Tattoo \u2014 Six Laser Sessions","main_description":"","image_pairs":[],"total_pairs":1,"gender":"Female","age":"18-30","age_group":"18-30","recovery":"Minimal (1-3 days)